.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-apple-brew-init 1  "stool-apple-brew-init "
.SH NAME
stool\-apple\-brew\-init \- Reuse Homebrew or install it with the official installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-apple\-brew\-init\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reuse Homebrew or install it with the official installer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show the plan without downloading, installing or evaluating the Brewfile
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Run without terminal input (requires privileges to be prepared separately)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
